# personal dial — never ship (the owner's own watch face; releases use assets/clock/homage_*.png).
# Also its copies in build output (bin/ is tracked in this repo), so a build can't sneak it into a commit.
assets/clock/dial.png
**/assets/clock/dial.png

# ---- 2026-10-24: the owner's PERSONAL assets - never tracked, never shipped ----
# They stay on the owner's PC (the code uses them when present and falls back to original public
# content when absent). installer/grandstand_publish.ps1 leaves them out and fails if one slips in.
# Also their copies in build output (bin/ is tracked in this repo).
